:"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/main/x-pack/plugin/transform/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/checkpoint/DefaultCheckpointProvider.java#L116\r\n\r\nWhen `remoteClusterResolver.resolve(transformConfig.getSource().getIndex())` returns no results, the `ActionListener<Map<String, long[]>> listener` is never called, causing the Transform to be started but stuck in `indexing`.\r\n\r\nAny subsequent call to the `stats` API will cause the API call to timeout and the transport task to hang indefinitely.\r\n\r\n### Steps to Reproduce\r\n\r\n- spin up cluster\r\n- add `Sample Web Logs` sample data\r\n- create a working transform:\r\n```\r\nPUT _transform/last-log-from-clientip\r\n{\r\n  \"source\": {\r\n    \"index\": [\r\n      \"kibana_sample_data_logs\"\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"latest\": {\r\n    \"unique_key\": [ \r\n      \"clientip\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"sort\": \"timestamp\" \r\n  },\r\n  \"frequency\": \"1m\", \r\n  \"dest\": {\r\n    \"index\": \"last-log-from-clientip\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sync\": { \r\n    \"time\": {\r\n      \"field\": \"timestamp\",\r\n      \"delay\": \"60s\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"retention_policy\": { \r\n    \"time\": {\r\n      \"field\": \"timestamp\",\r\n      \"max_age\": \"30d\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"settings\": {\r\n    \"max_page_search_size\": 500\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n- create a failing transform:\r\n```\r\nPUT _transform/last-log-from-clientip-failed\r\n{\r\n  \"source\": {\r\n    \"index\": [\r\n      \"*:blah\"\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"latest\": {\r\n    \"unique_key\": [ \r\n      \"clientip\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"sort\": \"timestamp\" \r\n  },\r\n  \"frequency\": \"1m\", \r\n  \"dest\": {\r\n    \"index\": \"last-log-from-clientip-failed\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sync\": { \r\n    \"time\": {\r\n      \"field\": \"timestamp\",\r\n      \"delay\": \"60s\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"retention_policy\": { \r\n    \"time\": {\r\n      \"field\": \"timestamp\",\r\n      \"max_age\": \"30d\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"settings\": {\r\n    \"max_page_search_size\": 500\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"prwhelan","id":1223797,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM3OTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223797?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan","html_url":"https://github.com/prwhelan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prwhelan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/106790/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/106790/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}